topics.derivation:
\[
a^n = \begin{cases}
1 & n=0 \\
(a^{n/2})^2 & n \text{ even} \\
a \cdot a^{n-1} & n \text{ odd}
\end{cases}
\]
Iterative: `res=1`; while `n`: if `n&1` `res*=a`; `a*=a`; `n>>=1`.  
Complexity `O(log n)` multiplications. Modulo: reduce after each mul. For matrix expo, each “mul” is `O(d^3)` → `O(d^3 log n)`.

